WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.786
Tina: Oh no!

2
00:00:12.787 --> 00:00:14.604
Danny: What’s the matter?

3
00:00:14.605 --> 00:00:17.481
Tina: Where did Hopian go?

4
00:00:17.482 --> 00:00:19.009
Danny: He’s a big guy.

5
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:21.959
He can take care of himself.

6
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:26.274
Danny: Do you smell something?

7
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:29.234
Tina: It smells good!

8
00:00:29.235 --> 00:00:34.882
Brad: It smells like breakfast to me!

9
00:00:34.883 --> 00:00:38.640
All three: Good morning, Hopian.

10
00:00:38.641 --> 00:00:42.332
Hopian: Good morning. I’ve cooked some breakfast.

11
00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:44.222
Have a seat.

12
00:00:44.223 --> 00:00:47.697
Danny: Uh, maybe we’ll eat on the floor.

13
00:00:47.698 --> 00:00:54.875
Hopian: I’ve got an idea.

14
00:00:54.876 --> 00:00:56.689
Hopian: Eat your breakfasts.

15
00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:00.058
You’ll need your strength.

16
00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:03.542
Hopian: Meanwhile, I'll tell you about Tristay.

17
00:01:03.543 --> 00:01:06.243
Hopian: This information might help you.

18
00:01:06.244 --> 00:01:10.921
Hopian: He’s been stealing the color from our world.

19
00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:14.596
Hopian: When Tristay was growing up, he was normal.

20
00:01:14.597 --> 00:01:17.748
Hopian: He was just like any other giant.

21
00:01:17.749 --> 00:01:21.602
Hopian: As a young giant, I had many friends.

22
00:01:21.603 --> 00:01:26.023
Hopian: Tristay wasn’t as lucky as me.

23
00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:29.338
Hopian: He never played with me or my friends.

24
00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:33.804
Hopian: We would ask him to join us, but he never would.

25
00:01:33.805 --> 00:01:38.443
Hopian: Perhaps it was because his fur wasn’t as bright as ours.

26
00:01:38.444 --> 00:01:44.871
Hopian: Then one day he did something mean.

27
00:01:44.872 --> 00:01:49.561
Hopian: He threw a rock at me and hurt me.

28
00:01:49.562 --> 00:01:52.528
Hopian: I got angry and chased him.

29
00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:56.688
Hopian: I was bigger than Tristay, but he was faster.

30
00:01:56.689 --> 00:01:59.945
Hopian: I chased him toward the mountain.

31
00:01:59.946 --> 00:02:02.602
Brad: Did you catch him?

32
00:02:02.603 --> 00:02:08.974
Hopian: No. As he ran up the mountain, rocks got loose [n3@and rolled down behind him.

33
00:02:08.975 --> 00:02:13.309
Hopian: They blocked the path so no one could follow.

34
00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.405
Hopian: He made it all the way to the top.

35
00:02:16.406 --> 00:02:23.125
Hopian: The path up the mountain is still blocked today.

36
00:02:23.126 --> 00:02:25.863
Danny: So you never got back at him?

37
00:02:25.864 --> 00:02:28.253
Hopian: I didn’t want to hurt him.

38
00:02:28.254 --> 00:02:32.179
Hopian: I just wanted to tell him that he had hurt me.

39
00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:36.375
Hopian: But something happened to Tristay on that mountaintop.

40
00:02:36.376 --> 00:02:38.202
Tina: What?

41
00:02:38.203 --> 00:02:43.382
Hopian: When he reached the top, Tristay sat down and cried.

42
00:02:43.383 --> 00:02:46.652
Hopian: He was full of jealousy and hate.

43
00:02:46.653 --> 00:02:51.337
Hopian: His tears were black and they fell everywhere.

44
00:02:51.338 --> 00:02:58.174
Hopian: He didn’t know it then, but the mountaintop is full of magic.

45
00:02:58.175 --> 00:03:03.019
Hopian: He slammed his fist against the ground. Sparks flew.

46
00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:07.836
Hopian: He didn’t notice the sparks, but he felt different.

47
00:03:07.837 --> 00:03:10.553
Hopian: He reached for the nearest object.

48
00:03:10.554 --> 00:03:12.956
Hopian: It was a red flower.

49
00:03:12.957 --> 00:03:17.771
Suddenly it became gray.

50
00:03:17.772 --> 00:03:21.365
Brad: Is that when he started stealing color?

51
00:03:21.366 --> 00:03:22.886
Hopian: I don’t know.

52
00:03:22.887 --> 00:03:26.208
No one saw him for many years.

53
00:03:26.209 --> 00:03:30.359
Hopian: My friends and I grew up and forgot about him.

54
00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:31.867
Hopian: Now he’s back.

55
00:03:31.868 --> 00:03:36.737
And he’s using his power to steal our color.

56
00:03:36.738 --> 00:03:40.713
Danny: We have to stop him.
